+    <h2>4. Accounts</h2>
+    <p>If you create an account we collect only a username and a password. They are used solely to create, secure and sign in to your account. You may choose a pseudonymous username. We do not ask for your email address or real name.</p>
+
+    <h2>5. Analytics, advertising and third parties</h2>
+    <p>We do not run third-party analytics or tracking scripts, and fonts are served from our own domain, so your IP address is not shared with font providers. Sign-in and sign-up requests are sent to our authentication service without cookies or referrer information. We send security and privacy headers that limit which third parties pages may contact.</p>
 </LegalLayout>
